WEBVTT

01:21.360 --> 01:26.770
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.520 --> 01:29.789
[Episod 29]

01:38.479 --> 01:39.030
Cik...

01:56.840 --> 01:57.430
Xuruo.

02:04.200 --> 02:04.920
Pak lang.

02:05.710 --> 02:06.400
Pak Yu.

02:09.280 --> 02:09.960
Saya

02:10.360 --> 02:12.020
nak balik ke halaman sendiri.

02:12.190 --> 02:13.920
Ini bukan arah ke halaman awak.

02:14.150 --> 02:16.280
Kalau dah mabuk, cepat pergi berehat.

02:17.280 --> 02:17.800
Baik.

02:18.470 --> 02:19.270
Kalau begitu,

02:20.850 --> 02:21.810
saya balik dulu.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.590
Kenapa dia minum begitu banyak?

02:32.590 --> 02:33.270
Jiuheng,

02:33.310 --> 02:34.520
saya tak hantar awak
masuk ke bilik pengantin.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.240
Saya pergi tengok dia.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.710
Baik, awak pergi tengok dia.

02:36.710 --> 02:38.120
Semoga cepat menimang anak.

02:38.120 --> 02:38.590
Xuruo!

02:53.000 --> 02:53.930
Tuan Yanyun...

